WEBVTT

00:01:28.458 --> 00:01:30.518
Each of us had different roles.

00:01:30.542 --> 00:01:33.184
One was great
at putting the look together.

00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:36.976
Another one was better
at negotiating the discount.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.434
And a third was always the timekeeper

00:01:39.458 --> 00:01:42.750
to make sure that we got back
to school on time.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:46.226
Shopping is so much more
than what you buy.

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:48.726
It's a treasure hunt
to discover something new,

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:52.393
a personalized recommendation
from someone you trust.

00:01:52.417 --> 00:01:55.268
It's a negotiation to get that great deal

00:01:55.292 --> 00:01:58.000
and a time spent catching up
with friends and family.

00:01:59.292 --> 00:02:01.268
It's social, it's interactive,